cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Verifier-Guided Multi-Teacher Distillation for Streaming Tissue Tracking
message: >-
  If you use this code or the released checkpoint, please cite this repository
  and the STIR dataset. A GitHub star is also very welcome.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Danush Kumar
    family-names: Venkatesh
