repository-code: 'https://github.com/danushkv/STIR2026_challenge'
abstract: >-
  A single LiteTracker student distilled from an ensemble of six point trackers.
  The IR-tattoo endpoint annotation in STIR, together with cycle consistency and
  cross-teacher agreement, verifies candidate trajectories and fuses them into
  weighted pseudo-labels. Team NCT_TSO, STIR Challenge 2026.
